  "description_text": "Discover Canal Collective, an exceptional new community by Jake's D Corporation-Seattle's premier builder of thoughtfully designed urban in-fill homes. This limited collection of 6 distinctive residences blends modern style with everyday functionality, offering spacious floor plans, expert craftsmanship, and elevated finishes throughout. Perfectly situated in North Queen Anne and in the heart of the SPU campus, you're just moments from Queen Anne CBD, Fremont, and downtown Seattle, with endless dining, shopping, and recreation right outside your door. Each home is filled with natural light and designed for the way you live-featuring generous primary suites that comfortably accommodate king-sized beds, main-level dining spaces ideal for entertaining, and rooftop decks ready for sunset gatherings. Enjoy the convenience of easy-access parking equipped with an EV charger. With multiple floor plan options available, there's a home here to match your lifestyle. Experience the best of modern Seattle living-your new home at Canal Collective awaits.",
